WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
08:30 — Scan a spine. During breakfast tidy Fatima adds a spine on her phone so the kids’ shelves stop lying about what is already owned.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
16:00 — Kids on iPad. After school the iPad shelf is a game: they point at favourites, she marks duplicates before the next book fair.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
20:30 — Donation list. Laptop donation list for the weekend drop — titles leaving the house on purpose, not vanishing into a car boot.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Wishlist trim. Wishlist trimmed on the laptop so the next buy is intentional, not a double of something under the bed.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:20 — Phone lock. Phone confirms tonight’s adds before she locks the screen and calls it a weekly win.

